&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;（マテリアリティ）&lt;/b&gt; マテリアリティとKPIの設定&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;（E：環境）&lt;/b&gt; 二酸化炭素排出量の削減&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;（S：社会）&lt;/b&gt; 人的資本経営の推進、安全衛生管理の徹底&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;（G：ガバナンス） &lt;/b&gt;グループ経営体制の強化&lt;/p&gt;
