&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-right-style:dashed;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;"&gt;● 社会課題の解決&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● 低炭素社会への移行&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● 自然環境の保全&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-left-style:dashed;border-left-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-right-style:dashed;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;"&gt;● グループ研究開発機能強化、積極投資&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● 製品の長寿命化&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● 軽量化による資源の有効活用&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● CO2排出量ゼロの移動手段である自転車供給&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● 生産設備の効率改善&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● 燃料転換による削減&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● 省エネ活動によるCO２の削減&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
