&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-right-style:dashed;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;"&gt;● 人的資本経営の推進&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● 持続可能なサプライチェーン構築&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● DXの推進&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● 魅力ある職場環境の実現&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● 安全衛生推進&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● 地域との共生、地域社会へ貢献&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-left-style:dashed;border-left-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-right-style:dashed;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;"&gt;● ダイバーシティ＆インクルージョンの推進&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● 新たな価値を創造する人材の採用・育成&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● パートナーシップの強化&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● 品質・サービスの信頼性向上&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● グループ情報の一元化、AI・IoTの活用&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● ワークライフバランス、多様な働き方の推進&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● 安全衛生推進活動&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;● 社会貢献活動&lt;/p&gt;
