&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;当社入社&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:12.8pt;min-height:12.8pt;"&gt;
